# Deliberate allowlist: everything is excluded first, then exactly the files
# the locked release build needs are restored. A developer-local file, an
# editor directory, a generated credential, or a new top-level artifact can
# therefore never reach the build context by accident.
*

# Required by `cargo build --release --locked --bin permissionsync`.
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates
!src

# Test and integration material inside the restored trees. None of it is
# needed to build the executable, and keeping it out of the context keeps
# disposable-environment fixtures away from the builder entirely.
crates/**/integration
crates/**/tests
